{
  "bodyHash": "dwad0i7yupc=",
  "content": "<h1>沉浸式机械</h1><p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveMachinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p><p>\n一系列具有乡村风格的机械，用于运输、采矿和自动化操作，同时保持与原版风格较为接近。\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=_immersive_machinery:recipes&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveMachinery/tree/1.20.1&amp;resolution=48&amp;background=fancy&amp;row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的全景图\"></p><h2>铜鳍潜艇</h2><p>\n一种原始的潜艇，小巧灵活，非常适合水下探索。\n由导管提供动力，拥有无限的氧气供应，并可通过多种模块进行升级。\n按下（默认）H键可使用内置声纳高亮显示实体！\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/screenshots/copperfin.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h2>隧道挖掘机</h2><p>\n一种大型、缓慢但功能强大的机器，可以轻松挖掘泥土。\n按住Shift键和空格键可上下移动。\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/screenshots/tunnel-digger.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h2>红石绵羊</h2><p>\n一种小型原始的红石装置，用于自动化农场。\n它会检测附近的草和植物并进行收割。\n空闲或燃料耗尽时，它会返回初始位置。\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/screenshots/redstone-sheep.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h2>竹蜂无人机</h2><p>\n一种由改装四轴飞行器制成的无人机，能够运送物品。\n标记一个或多个方块作为输入和输出点，它就会开始工作。\n可选配置物品过滤器，避免垃圾物品在工厂中四处散落。\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/screenshots/bamboo-bee.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p><h2>合成配方</h2><p>使用内置的配方书或JEI等模组查看。</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=immersive_machinery:.*&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveMachinery/tree/1.20.1&amp;resolution=32&amp;animated=False&amp;row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方图\"></p><h1>沉浸式系列模组</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&amp;description=A lot of unique and vanilla-faithful armor sets.&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式盔甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&amp;description=A bunch of rustic aircraft to travel, transport, and explore!&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式飞行器\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&amp;description=Play custom melodies on various instruments and annoy your friends!&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&amp;description=Drag and drop, pixelate and hang up beautiful art.&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式画作\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&amp;description=A lightweight entity-tick-scheduler for doubling your TPS.&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式优化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&amp;description=Hides the ugly block selection outline when not relevant.&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"选择性边界\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&amp;description=A set of additional aircraft for Immersive Aircraft with Create support in mind.&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"多面飞行家\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&amp;description=A bunch of rustic machinery to transport, mine, and automate things.&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式机械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&amp;description=Create custom and fancy furniture in-game or choose from a vast online library.&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式家具\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&amp;description=Mysterious, long-forgotten portals scattered across the Overworld.&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式传送门\">\n</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=718e82b5eca29fe4c4f460b4fd3c2b39\" alt=\"用于简化页面部署的页面哈希值。\"></p>",
